{"t":"Sugar Oat","s":"sugar-oat-5273b","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Sugar_Oat_8e0638.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Sugar Oat</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Sugar Oat\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sugar_Oat_8e0638.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Tools and other Equipment<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Taming%20Items\">Taming Items</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10 - 200 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 6, 2011<br/>Summer Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20110714221326&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sugar_Oat_8e0638.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  sugar oat.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 2.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">A hermit near Carlin might be able to tell you more about it.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Used to tame a <a href=\"#/wiki/Wild%20Horse\">Wild Horse</a>. Can be obtained by combining sugar cane and <a href=\"#/wiki/Bunch%20of%20Wheat\">wheat</a>.\n</p><p>Failed: <b>The wild horse happily munches the sugar oat and runs on.</b><br/>\nFailed: <b>Weeeheeeehee.</b><br/>\nFailed: <b>With its last strength the horse the horse runs to safety.</b><br/>\nSucceeded: <b>The horse eats the sugar oat and accepts you as its new master.</b>\n</p>\n<br/><table id=\"w-toc\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\">\n<p><b>How to make Sugar Oat</b>\n</p><p>To make Sugar Oat, you will need a <a href=\"#/wiki/Sickle\">Sickle</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Scythe\">Scythe</a>, a Bunch of Sugar Cane, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat\">Wheat</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bug\">Fire Bug</a>.\n</p><p>1. Travel to <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty bay</a> and buy <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bug\">Fire Bugs</a> from Evan <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32259,32881,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32259, 32881, 7)</a>.<br/>\n2. Go to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20Cane\">Sugar Canes</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32227,32797,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32227, 32797, 7)</a> and use the <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bug\">Fire Bugs</a> to burn the <a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20Cane\">Sugar Canes</a> down.<br/>\n3. Pick up the Bunch of Sugar Canes using <a href=\"#/wiki/Sickle\">Sickle</a> and travel to <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> wheat field <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32437,32246,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32437, 32246, 7)</a>.<br/>\n4. Cut down the wheat with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Scythe\">Scythe</a>.<br/>\n5. Use the <a href=\"#/wiki/Bunch%20of%20Wheat\">Bunch of Wheat</a> on the Bunch of Sugar Cane.\n</p><p>Note: You can use the Sugar Oats on <a href=\"#/wiki/Wild%20Horse\">Wild Horse</a> to get the <a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Horse\">War Horse</a> mount.<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Horse\"><img alt=\"War_Horse\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/War_Horse_ed42c6.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bane%20Lord\">Bane Lord</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bane%20Lord\">Bane Lord</a></li><li>Bosses</li><li>Bunch of Sugar Cane</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bunch%20of%20Wheat\">Bunch of Wheat</a></li><li>Event Creatures</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bug\">Fire Bug</a></li><li>Guide:Moneymaking</li><li>Guide:Mounts</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/horse-station-world-change\">Horse Station World Change</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a></li><li>Lucky Horseshoe</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Scythe\">Scythe</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sickle\">Sickle</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20Cane\">Sugar Cane</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Taming%20Items\">Taming Items</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Horse\">War Horse</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat\">Wheat</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wild%20Horse\">Wild Horse</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["horse-station-world-change"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"horse-station-world-change","quest":"Horse Station World Change","step":"1-2","n":4,"title":"Usar Sugar Oat no Wild Horse","kind":"needed","coords":[]}],"drops":[{"creature":"Bane Lord","pct":100.0,"qty":"1","hp":"3,000","exp":"500","loc":"Green Claw Swamp , on the Bewitched area.","places":[{"name":"Green Claw Swamp","x":32759,"y":31989,"z":7,"href":"#/wiki/Green%20Claw%20Swamp"},{"name":"Bewitched","x":32699,"y":32009,"z":7,"href":"#/quest/bewitched"}],"href":"#/wiki/Bane%20Lord"}],"spots":[{"x":32259,"y":32881,"z":7,"text":"1. Travel to Liberty bay and buy Fire Bugs from Evan here . 2. Go to the Sugar Canes here and use the Fire Bugs to burn the Sugar Canes down. 3. Pick up the Bunch of Sugar Canes using Sickle and travel to Thais wheat field here . 4. Cut down the wheat with…"},{"x":32227,"y":32797,"z":7,"text":"